# TanStack Router auto-generated route tree (regenerated on every build)
src/routeTree.gen.ts

# Lockfile deliberately not committed. vercel.json installs with
# `npm install --legacy-peer-deps`, and main has never carried a lockfile, so
# production resolves semver ranges fresh at deploy time. Committing one would
# silently pin prod to whatever tree happened to exist on one dev machine.
package-lock.json

